codex
The evidence supports suppression during maintenance when `users_affected` is at most 0.5. This rule matches all 32 labels, including cases that previously escalated under the critical-tier rule. I will add a ReLU gate that preserves every existing decision outside this region. The exact threshold remains an inference because no query answers are available.

